    "title": "Danville School Board honors Superintendent Scholars at recent meeting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Davin Wilson ,\n6 hours ago Danville Public Schools (DPS) Superintendent Dr. Angela Hairston and the Danville School Board honored the 2025-26 Superintendent Scholars during its bi-weekly meeting Thursday night at Central Offices. DPS and the board honored 35 students from three different schools for their accomplishments. Sofia Mendez-Ibarra, Billy Richardson III, Ty’Rique Walker and Jasir... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
